# Live heuristic defaults, applied at engine startup (src/core/HeuristicDefaults.h).
# Each non-comment line is KEY=VALUE, applied as the DEFAULT for getenv(KEY) unless KEY is already
# set in the environment (an explicit env var overrides = the disable / A-B lever).
#
# auto_heuristics.py APPENDS/updates a line here when it autonomously adopts a heuristic variant
# (adopt-then-review). To disable an adopted heuristic: set its env var to the baseline, or delete
# its line here. Empty (no KEY=VALUE lines) = stock engine behavior (byte-identical).
#
# (no adopted heuristics yet)
